      "verse": 1,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And afterward Moses and Aaron went in, and told Pharaoh, Thus saith the LORD God of Israel, Let my people go, that they may hold a feast unto me in the wilderness.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "EXO.5.2",
      "edition_verse_id": "KJV1769:EXO.5.2",
      "verse": 2,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And Pharaoh said, Who ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "is",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " the LORD, that I should obey his voice to let Israel go? I know not the LORD, neither will I let Israel go.",
